<title>FRANCE: Waigel says no EMU pact agreement yet.</title>
<headline>Waigel says no EMU pact agreement yet.</headline>
<dateline>POITIERS, France 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Finance Minister Theo Waigel said on Friday that France and Germany had not yet agreed on a budget deficit control pact.</p>
<p>&quot;Not yet but we have found a good way,&quot; Waigel told Reuters when asked if a final agreement had been reached.</p>
<p>The European Union hopes to agree to the accord at an EU summit in Amsterdam on Monday and Tuesday.</p>
</text>
